--- !u!114 &751122942
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 751122940}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b58ee1c4ed8bd1542be3e660daf4b8fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PPTManager
  pages:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe62704cebc0de14c88bc04a35be516e, type: 3}
    description: 'I bought Blasphemous almost entirely because of its art style.
      The character designs and religious imagery looked incredible. Honestly, it
      felt like I was buying the game just to appreciate its art book.

'
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5828a044550352b408ff4a3210d511b6, type: 3}
    description: 'I watched videos of the game and saw some incredible boss designs.
      But when I actually played, I couldn''t even find those legendary bosses. And
      the bosses I did manage to find? I couldn''t beat them either.

'
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 176a094b2ca9ee94b94f408dd38f8c1a, type: 3}
    description: 'So this time, we''re going straight to Isidora, Voice of the Dead.
      She''s one of the toughest bosses in Blasphemous. Since this is my dream, there''s
      no need to spend hours trying to find her.

'
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 18aa79e35ad0a2e45bc0680542599ad9, type: 3}
    description: 'There''s just one problem. This boss has complicated attacks and
      animations. Unfortunately, I don''t have the Unity skills to recreate all of
      them. So I came up with a much simpler solution.

'
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 38b56dcb6fdbb2c4facd60fdca9e2d7d, type: 3}
    description: 'Dead Cells has already crossed over with Blasphemous. So why not
      invite the Beheaded into my dream? No complicated boss mechanics. No endless
      retries. Just one powerful kick to send Isidora flying.

'
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    description: "A / D \u2014 Move left / right\r\nSpace \u2014 Jump\r\n"
  picture: {fileID: 2058378610}
  text: {fileID: 86954411}
