--- !u!114 &1480486962
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1480486960}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b58ee1c4ed8bd1542be3e660daf4b8fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PPTManager
  pages:
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6acb0bfd27e78245999e1741c7b9d6a, type: 3}
    description: 'This game exists purely to torture players. Hidden traps, unexpected
      deaths, and ridiculous challenges. Sometimes it feels like the developer''s
      only goal was to make players suffer.

'
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f76c2c38c4d9ad8479a3f35de446c25a, type: 3}
    description: 'A friend convinced me to try this game. I downloaded it, but deleted
      it almost immediately. Because I suddenly realized something terrifying.

'
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2d871e42adfc5ed47b2455e1876b0ca3, type: 3}
    description: 'If I actually finished this game, would I ever feel safe walking
      outside again? What if an apple fell from a tree and killed me? What if the
      floor suddenly collapsed? This game was going to give me trust issues.

'
  - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7b1c278a7b7690049994e49d12f8e8f5, type: 3}
    description: 'But there''s one thing I never understood. How can a single apple
      kill someone instantly? Aren''t apples supposed to be eaten? Well, in my dream,
      you can just eat them instead. Yummy!

'
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    description: "A / D \u2014 Move left / right\r\nSpace \u2014 Jump\r\n"
  picture: {fileID: 666274589}
  text: {fileID: 1595213398}
